    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $\\sigma_{s}^{2}$ is the variance among sires, $\\sigma_{d}^{2}$ is the variance among dams within sires, and $\\sigma_{e}^{2}$ is the variance within full-sib families.",
      "source_page": 585,
      "printed_page": 565,
